## Interface: 20506
## Title: GT Companion
## Notes: Companion to WowSimsExporter for Ruban's Gearing Tool. Dumps bank contents, bag contents, reputation standings, arena team ratings, and character identity/professions (none of which WowSimsExporter's own export reaches the Gearing Tool for) to SavedVariables, no clipboard needed. Stores every character on the account separately with a timestamp - /gtlist shows them all at a glance. Minimap button (left-click: status panel, right-click: save now) for less technical use.
## Version: 1.0.1
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\GearingToolCompanion\icon.tga
## SavedVariables: GTCompanionDB, GTCompanionMinimapDB
## Author: gearing-tool

GearingToolCompanion.lua
